WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.464
Four pillars hold up a brand strategy: relevance, distinctiveness, consistency and availability.

00:00:06.514 --> 00:00:09.298
Land all four and you get cut-through.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.108
McDonald's ticks every box.

00:00:12.158 --> 00:00:13.511
It meets a real need,

00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:15.127
the golden arches stand out,

00:00:15.177 --> 00:00:17.598
and they've barely changed in decades.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.100
And it's available two ways.

00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:24.290
It comes to mind when you're hungry, and there's one on every corner.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.094
Use it like this:

00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:27.957
score your brand on each pillar,

00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:30.766
then fix the weakest one first.
